    "document_type": "communication",
    "policy_area": "Environment",
    "article": "Body",
    "target_text": "Economic progress and pollution reduction can go together: between 2000 and 2017, the EU's GDP grew by 32% while emissions of the main air pollutants decreased by 10% (ammonia, mainly from agriculture) to 70% (sulphur oxides, mainly from industrial production) 10 .",
